stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Forming: Team created (1 member; minSize > 1)
    [*] --> Ready: Team created (minSize = 1)
    Forming --> Ready: memberCount reaches minSize
    Ready --> Forming: memberCount drops below minSize
    Forming --> Deleted: final member leaves
    Ready --> Deleted: final member leaves (when minSize = 1)
    Deleted --> [*]
    note right of Deleted
      Team is logically deleted and
      removed from active queries.
      Audit history is preserved.
    end note
